OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze at
OL,4,ACrumlin Road courthouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are attending the scene of
OL,7,Fa fire at the former Crumlin Road
OL,8,Fcourthouse in north Belfast.
OL,10,FThe Crumlin Road has been closed in
OL,11,Fboth directions between Agnes Street
OL,12,Fand Carlisle Circus due to the fire,
OL,13,Fpolice said. Access to the Mater
OL,14,FHospital is available.
OL,16,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,17,FService says it has "five fire
OL,18,Fappliances and an aerial appliance in
OL,19,Fattendance dealing with this ongoing
OL,20,Fincident".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
